"│  9.3 /proc and /sys    ││    RAM is much faster than any disk. When a program│"
"│  9.4 Links, inodes and…││    reads a file, Linux keeps a copy in the page    │"
"│  9.5 fstab and mount o…││    cache, so the next read comes straight from     │"
